ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "Here, we hypothesized that knee pain and low back pain were independently and additively correlated with sleep duration and quality and conducted a cross-sectional study by analyzing a dataset of the Nagahama Prospective Cohort for Comprehensive Human Bioscience (Nagahama Study), which is a large-scale population-based cohort study in Japan.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:26444713") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4622045/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000531)
