ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In accordance with these considerations, we conducted an open label, naturalistic prospective study investigating genetic markers associated with abstinence in alcohol-dependent subjects treated with acamprosate in community-based programs.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:25290263") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4350512/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001595)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In addition to the CRC case-control set, a separate case-control set (NHS_5_AD) was constructed of participants diagnosed with advanced adenoma matched to control participants who underwent a lower endoscopy in the same time period and did not have an adenoma.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0286-6/MediaObjects/41588_2018_286_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002144)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In addition to the individuals within the WGS panel, additional individuals, 10,242 of which were included in the final analysis, were chosen for whole-exome sequencing from 10 studies: the Jackson Heart Study (500 African-American cases, 526 matched controls)") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29257133") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5735917/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000001 coho:COHO_0000344)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In both GOCHA and GASROS, AFib status was determined by reviewing medical records, and/or interview subjects or their families.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29892015") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0133-9/MediaObjects/41588_2018_133_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") coho:COHO_0000001 coho:COHO_0002063)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, BIOSTAT-CHF was a multicentre, multinational, prospective observational study, in which 2516 patients with new-set or worsening signs and/or symptoms of heart failure from 11 European countries, who were on suboptimal guideline recommended treatment (i.e., ≤ 50% of target doses of ACEi/ARBs and beta-blockers), were enrolled.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:32002631") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7375987/") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001535)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, GISSI-P patients were selected on the basis of a clinical diagnosis of recent (< = 3 months) MI, with no limits of age and distinction of sex.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:20403154") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2871267/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001808)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, JUPITER was a randomized, double‐blind, placebo‐controlled trial of rosuvastatin 20 mg daily versus placebo in the primary prevention of CVD in 17 802 asymptomatic men ≥50 years and women ≥60 years") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:32799709") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7660788/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000921)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, SPS3 was a randomized, multicenter clinical trial conducted in 81 clinical centers in North America, Latin America, and Spain.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:23726159") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3979302/unicode") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002406)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, YOUNG-AF was a partly prospective, partly retrospective, observational study performed at the University Medical Center Groningen, The Netherlands.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:31890859") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6923497/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002705)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, adult patients (≥ 18 years) with cancer who were intended to start treatment with fluoropyrimidine-based therapy in 17 hospitals in the Netherlands were included.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:39148102") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11325793/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000217)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, the Canadian Breast Cancer Study, a population-based case-control study, invited women with in situ or invasive breast cancer, diagnosed from April 2005 to May 2009 [12].") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:30601841") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6314637/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000899)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, unselected participants of the German screening colonoscopy program are recruited by gastroenterology practices in southern Germany in this multicenter study.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29574091") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6035076/") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001537)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In examining a cohort of 45 Brazilian babies from the State of Rio Grande do Norte we undertook WES to ascertain that none of 44 babies presenting with Zika-associated microcephaly were due to pathogenic genetic variants known to be associated with this clinical trait.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:33087711") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC7578642/unicode") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000019)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In four patients from the Polish glioma cohort, we identified a novel recurrent mutation in the TOP2A gene coding for Topoisomerase 2A in glioblastomas (GBM, WHO grade IV gliomas).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004556") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000318)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In light of these findings, we initiated an in-depth follow-up of the GWA association finding in a Flanders–Belgian cohort of well-characterized AD patients and control individuals (n=1883).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:21403675") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3265835/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001522)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In order to address previous limitations in pooling data, in using common toxicity scoring systems and in collecting standardized data, REQUITE carried out an international, multi-center, prospective observational study.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:33178576") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7593843/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002314)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In order to investigate the factors, especially genetic components, responsible for CRC we established the Newfoundland Colorectal Cancer Registry.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:17039269") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17039269+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000601)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In order to investigate the genetic architecture of T2D in African Americans, the MEta-analysis of type 2 DIabetes in African Americans (MEDIA) Consortium examined 17 GWAS on T2D comprising 8,284 cases and 15,543 controls in African Americans in stage 1 analysis.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:25102180") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A25102180+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") coho:COHO_0000001 coho:COHO_0002052)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In recognition of the need for large-scale sample collections to empower GWAS, we established the Genetic Consortium for Anorexia Nervosa (GCAN) in 2007—a worldwide collaboration combining existing DNA samples of AN patients into a single resource.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:24514567") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4325090/") coho:COHO_0000001 coho:COHO_0000077)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In response to this, the Genetic Links to Anxiety and Depression (GLAD) Study was developed to recruit >40,000 individuals into the newly established National Institute for Health Research (NIHR) Mental Health BioResource.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:31715324") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6891252/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001010)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In short, the DiscovEHR cohort is a subset of individuals enrolled in the Geisinger Healthcare system who consented to participate in Geisinger's MyCode Community Health Initiative.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:34184762") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8457092/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000776)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In short, the REVEAL-HBV cohort study followed participants aged 30 to 65 in Taiwan from 1991 to 2004 who were Hepatitis B virus surface antigen positive") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29600553") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5980724/") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002317)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In stage 1, we recruited 1,276 type 2 diabetic patients from the Shanghai Diabetes Institute Inpatient Database of Shanghai Jiao Tong University Affiliated Sixth People’s Hospital (10,11) and examined them for diabetic retinopathy and nephropathy.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:21911749") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3198055/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002358)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the 300BCG study, 321 healthy (male and female) adult volunteers of Western European ancestry were included from April 2017 until June 2018.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7641012/") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0000208)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the 6th wave of the study, which was used in the current study, 19,762 residents were invited and 12,984 (65.7%) participated (53% women, age range 30–87 years). 660 migraine cases and 2,407 controls were genotyped and in included in this study.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:27322543") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3598/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3598_MOESM73_ESM.pdf") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002431)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the EMIF-AD MBD study we retrospectively combined and reused clinical data, samples and scans that had already been collected as part of existing prospective cohort studies.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29980228") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6035398/fullTextXML") coho:COHO_0000001 coho:COHO_0000581)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the GIFT study, 201 families were recruited consisting of 438 siblings with an objectively confirmed VTE at a young age.") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:23742623") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A23742623+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0001804)
ClassAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the HD10 study for early stages (CS I, II without risk factors) patients were randomized to receive 2 or 4 cycles of doxorubicin, bleomycin, vinblastine, and dacarbazine (ABVD) followed by either 30 Gy or 20 Gy involved-field (IF) radiotherapy (Engert et al, 2010).") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:23321510") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3553532/") coho:COHO_0000000 coho:COHO_0002714)
